 state←NewStormState
⍝ Returns an empty state for the storm guard.\\
⍝ `signatures`, `counts`, `lastFulls`, `firsts`, `lasts` and `lastFullTimes` hold one item per signature:
⍝ the signature, the number of occurrences, the count at which it last got the full treatment, the times
⍝ of its first and last occurrence, and the time of its last full treatment. Until a signature gets its first
⍝ full treatment, that last time is the time of its first occurrence.\\
⍝ `fulls` holds the times of the most recent full treatments, across all signatures.\\
⍝ All times are seconds since 1970-01-01, UTC.
 state←⎕NS''
 state.signatures←0⍴⊂''
 state.counts←⍬
 state.lastFulls←⍬
 state.firsts←⍬
 state.lasts←⍬
 state.lastFullTimes←⍬
 state.fulls←⍬
